The '''Olega Jedi temple''' was a [[Jedi temple]] situated on<ref name="Databank Temple">{{Databank|olega-jedi-temple|Olega Jedi temple}}</ref> the [[planet]]<ref name="Databank Olega">{{Databank|olega|Olega}}</ref> [[Olega]] during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Episode II" /> In [[132 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TheAcolyteDate}}</ref> the [[Jedi Master]] [[Torbin]] was murdered by [[Mae-ho Aniseya|Mae Aniseya]] from [[bunta]] [[poison]], while Jedi Master [[Sol]] and his companions were sent there to investigate.<ref name="Episode II" />

The presence of Jedi outposts and Temples across the Galaxy was widespread during the [[High Republic Era]].

